flowchart LR
    A[POST /api/trips/:id/chat] --> B[Load Trip State\nJSON store]
    B --> C[Initialize AgentState]

    subgraph STATE[AgentState]
      M[messages]
      T[trip]
      P[plan]
      CS[current_step]
      L[last_agent]
      I[iteration_count]
      CR[critique]
      PC[pending_changes]
    end

    C --> D[LangGraph Runtime]
    D --> O[Orchestrator Node]
    O --> SA[Search Agent]
    O --> TA[Travel Editor Agent]
    O --> CH[ChitChat]

    SA --> ST[Search Tool Node]
    ST --> SA

    TA --> TX[Custom Travel Tool Executor]
    TX --> TA

    SA --> K[Critic]
    TA --> K

    K --> RF[Response Formatter]
    K --> HR[Human Review]

    RF --> E[Final Agent Message]
    HR --> E
    CH --> E

    E --> S[Persist Updated Trip]
    S --> Z[Chat API Response]
